"For each item below, fetch its source and check that the recorded quote appears on the page and supports the item. A card item is a field of the plan in the producer's words, with the sources it cites: check each factual claim in it against those sources, and any value it carries against the page; what the plan will build, measure or predict needs no source, but a factual claim with no source is UNSUPPORTED. For a cost input, check that the page states the number for the setting given; whether it applies to this plan is not yours to judge. When the page states a different number for a num or rate item, give it as page_value. Decide only from the pages you fetch and the text below; do not read files. Return one status per item, under its ref: SUPPORTED, PARTIAL, UNSUPPORTED, CONTRADICTED or UNREACHABLE, with the page sentence you relied on.
Items, one per line:
{\"ref\":\"card:question\",\"text\":\"Does 10 to 1,000 AIFS-ENS members beat 50 for top-percentile wind, temperature, and rain probability forecasts, or does shared model error cap the skill?\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:hypothesis\",\"text\":\"More members keep helping: 1,000 members sample top-percentile tails far better than 50, so extreme-event scores keep improving [s_hens].\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_hens\",\"url\":\"https://gmd.copernicus.org/articles/18/5605/2025/\",\"quote\":\"we generate a huge ensemble (HENS), with 7424 members initialized each day of summer 2023\"}]}
{\"ref\":\"card:if_lever\",\"text\":\"Skill on top-percentile wind, temperature, and rain keeps rising past 50 members: 1,000 members sharpen the tails and improve extreme-event scores.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:if_not\",\"text\":\"Skill flattens near 50 members: members are exchangeable draws of one trained distribution, so shared model error caps tail sharpness and extra members add nothing.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:test_summary\",\"text\":\"Run 7,000 fifteen-day AIFS-ENS v1 forecasts (7 dates x 1,000 members) on eight A100 40 GB GPUs; subsample 10-1,000 members, score top-percentile wind/temperature/rain probabilities against ERA5 with fair CRPS and Brier scores, and test whether skill still rises past 50 members.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:closest_prior\",\"text\":\"HENS Part 2: 7,424 SFNO members per day for 92 summer-2023 dates; showed huge ensembles sample 4-sigma tails and reduce outliers.\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_hens\",\"url\":\"https://gmd.copernicus.org/articles/18/5605/2025/\",\"quote\":\"we generate a huge ensemble (HENS), with 7424 members initialized each day of summer 2023\"}],\"value\":7424}
{\"ref\":\"card:left_open\",\"text\":\"Whether AIFS-ENS, whose members are exchangeable draws of one afCRPS-trained distribution, keeps gaining skill past 50 members or saturates from shared model error.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:anchor\",\"text\":\"Reproduce the published 4-minute N320 member time and 38 GB memory; one control run must match ECMWF open data within ensemble spread [s_crps_paper].\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_crps_paper\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2412.15832\",\"quote\":\"a single member 15 day forecast is created in about one minute for AIFS-CRPS O96 and four minutes for AIFS-CRPS N320 on an NVIDIA A100 40 GB GPU, including the time spent reading the initial state and writing the forecast to disk.\"}],\"value\":\"4 min per N320 member on A100 40 GB; 38 GB GPU memory\"}
{\"ref\":\"card:limits\",\"text\":\"Applies to AIFS-ENS v1 medium-range extremes on 7 dates; not a multi-season reforecast, other models, subseasonal leads, or direct proof that shared error causes any saturation.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"src:s_hens\",\"url\":\"https://gmd.copernicus.org/articles/18/5605/2025/\",\"quote\":\"we generate a huge ensemble (HENS), with 7424 members initialized each day of summer 2023\",\"supports\":\"the closest prior's ensemble size (n_hens_members, novelty)\"}
{\"ref\":\"src:s_crps_paper\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2412.15832\",\"quote\":\"a single member 15 day forecast is created in about one minute for AIFS-CRPS O96 and four minutes for AIFS-CRPS N320 on an NVIDIA A100 40 GB GPU, including the time spent reading the initial state and writing the forecast to disk.\",\"supports\":\"per-member inference time at the exact N320 grid on the exact GPU (n_infer_min_member) and the anchor timing\"}
{\"ref\":\"num:n_infer_min_member\",\"name\":\"AIFS-CRPS N320 15-day per-member inference time\",\"value\":4,\"unit\":\"min\",\"basis\":\"CITED\",\"quote\":\"a single member 15 day forecast is created in about one minute for AIFS-CRPS O96 and four minutes for AIFS-CRPS N320 on an NVIDIA A100 40 GB GPU, including the time spent reading the initial state and writing the forecast to disk.\",\"page_setting\":\"AIFS-CRPS N320 (0.25 deg, same grid as public AIFS-ENS v1) on NVIDIA A100 40 GB\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2412.15832\"}
{\"ref\":\"num:n_hens_members\",\"name\":\"HENS (SFNO) ensemble size\",\"value\":7424,\"unit\":\"members\",\"basis\":\"CITED\",\"quote\":\"we generate a huge ensemble (HENS), with 7424 members initialized each day of summer 2023\",\"page_setting\":\"HENS Part 2 (SFNO-BVMC, 15-day, 0.25 deg)\",\"url\":\"https://gmd.copernicus.org/articles/18/5605/2025/\"}
{\"ref\":\"num:n_a100_usd_h\",\"name\":\"A100 40 GB on-demand price\",\"value\":1.99,\"unit\":\"USD/GPU-h\",\"basis\":\"CITED\",\"quote\":\"8x Instances pricing: NVIDIA A100 SXM | VRAM/GPU 40 GB | vCPUs 124 | RAM 1800 GiB | STORAGE 5.8 TiB SSD | PRICE/GPU/HR $1.99*\",\"page_setting\":\"Lambda on-demand pricing, 8x A100 SXM 40 GB\",\"url\":\"https://lambda.ai/pricing\"}

